An '''unnamed forest''' is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Unova]], and the setting of ''[[Mewtwo — Prologue to Awakening]]''.

The forest is near a mountain range where [[Virgil]] was forced to land his helicopter following a mission. He met two residents of the area, {{un|Anna}} and her grandfather {{un|Oscar}}, who told him about their encounter with [[Mewtwo (M16)|an unusual Pokémon]].

Later, after meeting a man named [[Dirk]], who informed him that the Pokémon was Mewtwo, Virgil set out with Anna and Oscar to find it. With some help from the local Pokémon as well as Anna and Oscar's {{p|Stoutland}}, Virgil's {{p|Eevee}}, {{p|Leafeon}}, and {{p|Vaporeon}} found Mewtwo. Dirk, who had misled the others by not telling them he was really a [[Pokémon hunter]], attacked with machines hoping to capture Mewtwo, leading to a battle that triggered a forest fire. Mewtwo put out the fire by dropping the water from a nearby lake onto it, then freed Dirk's Pokémon from his control and departed.

